        move('the Sifrei 129:6 (read whole at the reading); cold_run_erection (CALL) — ER.repeats(chagigah_overnight) = %s' % (ER_CHAG,), "FLOCK FOR THE PASSOVER AND HERD FOR THE FESTIVAL OFFERING (129:6 — the herd a second offering, the Passover Exodus 12:5's lamb upheld; another word: every obligation from unconsecrated beasts as the Passover — Mishnah Menachot 7:6); the fourteenth's festival offering not overnight the erection's reading of Exodus 34:25 by CALL")
