        return out("the leaven on the road (16:3-4) — return and remove when there is time, else nullify in the heart; the rescuer nullifies; the optional resident returns at once (Mishnah Pesachim 3:7 — the exam row read whole; pesach.leaven_machine's window %s by CALL): the traveler with time who returns accepted" % (CA_MATZAH,), ['accepted'])
